"""A word-and-phrase approximation to a discrete-action noun feature.

It responds to operations, commands, tests, steps, edits, queries and related
nouns, weakly to noun-forming suffixes, and separately to end-of-text.
Operations are stronger near computing words than military/business words.
A few action-target
phrases keep firing at 'made', 'to', or 'on'. Other tokens normally get zero.
The short text history is cleared at each document boundary.
